{:id "0027-lab-cues"
 :title "Lab: a finished word becomes a cue, from Half Ahead's own glossary first"
 :lupa/area :lab
 :lupa/risk :low
 :goal "When a word is finished, decide what it does, instantly and on the
        device: Half Ahead's glossary first (product voice, in
        halfahead.lab.glossary), then punctuation and the word's shape, then
        a quiet default. No model and no network; a later order may add a
        local model as a fallback behind the same function."
 :scope ["src/halfahead/lab/cues.cljc" "test/halfahead/lab/cues_test.cljc"]
 :design "New namespace halfahead.lab.cues (.cljc, pure):
            (word-cue word following) -> a valid :ha/word-cue
          word is as typed; following is the one-character string after it.
          Rules, in order:
          1. Glossary: look up (lower-case word) in
             halfahead.lab.glossary/entries, then the same without one
             trailing \"s\". A hit gives its effect and intensity, :source
             :glossary. If following is \"!\", add 0.2 to the intensity
             (at most 1.0).
          2. Punctuation, when there is no glossary hit: following \"!\" ->
             :quake 0.7; following \"?\" -> :wobble 0.5. :source :punctuation.
          3. Shape: a word of two or more letters written ALL IN CAPITALS ->
             :launch 0.8; a word of 12 or more characters -> :shimmer 0.5;
             a word made only of digits -> :pop 0.4. :source :shape.
          4. Otherwise :pop 0.3, :source :default.
          :word in the cue is the word as typed, truncated to 64 characters.
          Never throws for any non-blank word."
 :acceptance
 ["(word-cue \"deploy\" \" \") is :launch 0.9 :glossary; (word-cue \"Deploys\"
   \".\") also hits the glossary (lower-cased, trailing s removed);
   (word-cue \"ship\" \"!\") has intensity 1.0 (0.9 + 0.2, capped)"
  "(word-cue \"really\" \"!\") is :quake 0.7 :punctuation; (word-cue \"why\"
   \"?\") is :wobble 0.5 :punctuation"
  "(word-cue \"NOPE\" \" \") is :launch :shape; (word-cue
   \"internationalisation\" \" \") is :shimmer :shape; (word-cue \"2026\" \" \")
   is :pop 0.4 :shape"
  "(word-cue \"table\" \" \") is :pop 0.3 :default"
  "Property: for any non-blank word up to 200 characters and any
   following character, the result is a valid :ha/word-cue"
  "Every glossary entry's effect is a valid :ha/word-effect and its
   intensity in [0,1] (a test over the whole map, so editing the glossary
   cannot break the lab silently)"
  "`bb test` stays green on both hosts"]
 :non-goals
 ["Do not edit the glossary entries (that is product voice) or the schema"
  "No lexicons, models, or network"]
 :context ["src/halfahead/lab/glossary.cljc" "src/halfahead/schema.cljc"
           "docs/SCHEMA.md" "DESIGN.md"]
 :budget-usd 6.0}
